---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About us"
  description="A good society is made of people who feel capable, respected and involved. That's where Solidara begins too."
>
  <section class="about-header">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <h1>People first, at every stage of life.</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-content">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <p>
        "Participatiesamenleving" was the Dutch word of the year in 2013,
        meaning "participation society." It captured something people were
        already feeling: a good life, and a good society, isn't just handed
        to you by institutions. You take part in shaping it.
      </p>
      <p>
        That idea is older than 2013. Centuries earlier, the philosopher
        Spinoza, writing in this same country, argued that the whole point
        of a well-run society isn't to control people, but to give them the
        safety and freedom to develop their own minds, and think for
        themselves.
      </p>
      <p>
        It's even written into Dutch law today. The Constitution commits the
        state to creating room for people's <em>ontplooiing</em> (their
        social and cultural development), and for how they spend their free
        time. Growth. Becoming. Hobbies included.
      </p>
      <p>That's the frame Solidara wants to contribute to.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-image">
    <div class="container">
      <img
        src="/images/about-story.jpg"
        alt=""
        width="1600"
        height="900"
      />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-content">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <p>
        We start from a simple belief: a good society is made of people who
        feel capable, respected and involved. That's where we begin too,
        with the human being we are facing.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <blockquote class="pull-quote">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <p>Not a target group. Not a label. A human being.</p>
    </div>
  </blockquote>

  <section class="about-content">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <p>
        School ends. Some things turn out to have never really been taught.
        For some, school ended too early, or barely started at all. Either
        way, that's where we work.
      </p>
      <p>
        We support people's learning for life. The professional skills they
        need, the personal ones they want, even the hobby they never got
        round to: how to survive the digital madness, how to speak up in a
        meeting, how to live a bit more sustainably, how to feel part of
        your neighbourhood.
      </p>
      <p>
        Most of what happens at Solidara is people learning from each other:
        sharing what they know, trying things together, figuring it out
        side by side. Where it genuinely helps, an experienced trainer or
        instructor joins in. But they're there to support the learning, not
        to run it.
      </p>
      <p>
        And Solidara tries to work the same way. We're not only a place
        people come to; we're a place people can help build. If these aims
        are yours too, there's room here to shape what we do, not just take
        part in it. In its own small way, that's what a participation
        society looks like from the inside.
      </p>
      <p class="cta-line"><a href="/shape-with-us">Shape with us &rarr;</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .narrow {
      max-width: 640px;
    }

    .about-header {
      padding-block: 64px 8px;
    }
    .about-header h1 {
      font-size: 34px;
    }

    .about-content {
      padding-block: 24px;
    }
    .about-content p {
      font-size: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .about-content p:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    .about-content em {
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--color-ink);
    }

    .about-image {
      padding-block: 24px;
    }
    .about-image img {
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 12px;
      aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .pull-quote {
      margin: 40px 0;
      padding-block: 44px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-surface);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-surface);
    }
    .pull-quote p {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 26px;
      line-height: 1.4;
      color: var(--color-teal);
      margin: 0;
    }

    .cta-line {
      margin-top: 32px !important;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .cta-line a {
      color: var(--color-teal);
    }
    .cta-line a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
